{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日 6/10 （水）\n櫻坂46 15thシングル発売です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今作もこうして皆さんの元へ届けられることが\nとても嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に楽しみましょう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします ୨୧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobQ5r8im.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "What’s \"KAZOKU\"?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見ていただけましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "不思議で可愛い世界観\n撮影の時から完成が楽しみで\nワクワクしていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂を家族と捉えたコンセプトも素敵です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂の表題曲では割と珍しい\n明るくてキャッチーな曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かつ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『夜桜さんちの大作戦』\nのオープニングテーマを務めさせていただくということもあり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "より多くの方に\n櫻坂46を知っていただけるきっかけになれば嬉しいなと思っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に広めていきたいです\nたくさんの方に届けましょう .·*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1サビの KAZOKU の手振りは\nみんなにも真似してやってみてほしいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて思っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "手振りの最後の指差しは\nKAZOKU の U （you）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づいてた？ 𖠶𖠶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "通常速度だと\n速くてむずかしいですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆっくりならきっとできます…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ\nTikTok等で\nゆっくりテンポでやってみてください  ^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後日、私のInstagramに動画載せます〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと\nメンバーの可愛いところもいっぱい撮ったので\n少しずつ載せます *"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob43A2qE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "❤︎❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオ撮影は\nメンバーみんなわちゃわちゃ賑やかで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休憩時間も\nギューっとなっていたり\n愛おしい瞬間がたくさんでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな姿を見ていたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーが本当に家族のように見えてきて\nなんだかほっこりしました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob3V7LPF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "名前がついた 「ミミ」です 🐈‍⬛❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオの好きなシーン\n抜粋したいけれど\n全部好きで困ります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1つあげると"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ラストのポーズ前\n天さんと目を合わせるところ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しくて\nつい素の笑顔になっちゃいます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも可愛すぎます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "腕組みポーズは\n私がポーズに迷っていたら\n一緒にやろー！\nと誘ってくださりました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優しいです 🤦🏻‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに後付けで\n天さんがお父さんで私が娘という設定です（笑）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなふうに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "曲の1番最初と最後の\n家族写真をイメージしたポーズは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もしメンバーで1つの家族だったら\n自分はどんな役割かな？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "というのも含めて\nみんなで考えました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それも新鮮で楽しかったです ( ◜ᴗ◝ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真のポーズ\n逆再生になってるの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づきましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "振付、見どころがたくさんです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は\n振り入れの時からずっと\n自然と楽しんで踊っていました ^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhmanWO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "シンメのりかちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ただいま」も「おかえり」も無意識に"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "の歌詞のところが好きです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも目が合うところがあって\n2人で笑ってます ^ ^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今後探してみてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobAt173h.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhauC47.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CDTVライブ！ライブ！\nではフルサイズで初披露させていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました ︎ ︎✧︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオが公開される前\n初めてのパフォーマンス披露だったので\nドキドキでした〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きな楽曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも大切に届けていきます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんの日常の中で\n沢山見て聴いていただけたら嬉しいです .*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobPEeUF7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobmz89wG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村井優"}], "source": "official"}